        "language": "english",
        "review": "The controls just work (which is a low bar but surprisingly a lot of RTS/RTT games fail to clear it). It has grid hot keys, middle mouse drag (the default is \"drag the map\" and there is no invert setting, which is comfortable for me from SC2 muscle memory but might annoy you if you want to \"pan the camera\").\n\nThe units are weird, the pathfinding and vision system are a little janky. Its better than I expected. Again, the controls just work for me which is a huge relief. Lots of these indie strategy games everytime I try to move the camera it goes in the wrong direction which is hugely aggravating.",
